{"seq":1,"slug":"probability-calibration","title":"概率校准：让分类器的 0.9 真的是 90%","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/probability-calibration","wordCount":1521,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"概率校准-让分类器的-0-9-真的是-90\">概率校准：让分类器的 0.9 真的是 90%</h1><p>一个欺诈检测模型对某笔交易输出 0.9，风控团队据此决定是否拦截、赔付准备金留多少。可如果在所有输出 0.9 的交易里，真实为欺诈的比例其实只有 60%，那这个 0.9 就是谎言，所有依赖它做期望值计算的下游决策都会系统性偏错。概率校准就是修正这种偏差：学一个从模型原始打分到真实频率的映射，使输出的数值真的能当概率用。保序回归凭「单调、无形状假设」成为这里的主力工具。本篇建立校准的最小必要概念，把保序回归接入标准流水线，为 <a href=\"isotonic-vs-platt\">保序与 Platt</a> 的对比与 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图</a> 的诊断打底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-校准的定义与度量\">核心概念：校准的定义与度量</h2><p>一个模型是<strong>完美校准</strong>的，如果对任意预测值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，在所有预测为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本中，真实正例比例恰好是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{P}(Y = 1 \\mid \\hat{p}(X) = p) = p \\quad \\forall p \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>校准与区分能力（discrimination，如 AUC）是两个正交的维度：一个模型可以 AUC 很高（排序很准）却严重失准（数值全偏），也可以校准完美却毫无区分力（永远输出基础率）。校准只修数值、不改排序——因为保序映射单调，它不会改变样本的相对次序，所以<strong>校准后 AUC 不变</strong>，这是保序校准的一个重要保证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始分类器打分 s] --&gt; B[留出校准集&lt;br/&gt;独立于训练集]&#10;  B --&gt; C[拟合单调映射 g: s → p]&#10;  C --&gt; D{映射选择}&#10;  D --&gt;|无形状假设| E[保序回归&lt;br/&gt;本 hub 主角]&#10;  D --&gt;|sigmoid 假设| F[Platt/温度缩放]&#10;  E --&gt; G[校准后概率 p]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[评估: Brier / ECE / 可靠性图]&#10;  H --&gt; I[AUC 不变&lt;br/&gt;单调映射不改排序]\">graph TD\n  A[原始分类器打分 s] --&gt; B[留出校准集&lt;br/&gt;独立于训练集]\n  B --&gt; C[拟合单调映射 g: s → p]\n  C --&gt; D{映射选择}\n  D --&gt;|无形状假设| E[保序回归&lt;br/&gt;本 hub 主角]\n  D --&gt;|sigmoid 假设| F[Platt/温度缩放]\n  E --&gt; G[校准后概率 p]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[评估: Brier / ECE / 可靠性图]\n  H --&gt; I[AUC 不变&lt;br/&gt;单调映射不改排序]</pre><p>度量校准好坏的两个主力指标，列在下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义要点</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Brier 分数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{n}\\sum (\\hat{p}_i - y_i)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>严格适当评分，越小越好</td>\n<td>混合了校准与区分，不纯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECE（期望校准误差）</td>\n<td>分箱后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>b</mi></msub><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>conf</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_b \\frac{n_b}{n}\\lvert \\text{acc}_b - \\text{conf}_b\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.095em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conf</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>直接量校准偏差</td>\n<td>依赖分箱，可被操纵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对数损失</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\frac{1}{n}\\sum [y\\log\\hat p + (1-y)\\log(1-\\hat p)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>严格适当，重罚自信错误</td>\n<td>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p\\to 0,1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 极敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCE（最大校准误差）</td>\n<td>各箱偏差的最大值</td>\n<td>关注最差箱</td>\n<td>高方差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Brier 分数可以分解为「可靠性（校准误差）− 分辨率 + 不确定性」三项，这个分解解释了为什么单纯降 Brier 未必是在改校准——分辨率项也在动。ECE 的分箱依赖性则是 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图与过拟合</a> 的核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么模型会失准\">为什么模型会失准</h2><p>不同模型族有各自的失准指纹，理解它们才知道校准该往哪个方向修。</p>\n<p><strong>提升树（XGBoost/LightGBM）</strong> 倾向于把概率推向两端，因为它们优化的目标与叶子权重的组合会产生过度自信——输出常在 0.1 以下和 0.9 以上扎堆，中间稀疏。<strong>朴素贝叶斯</strong> 因独立性假设被违反而极端过度自信，概率几乎全贴到 0 或 1。<strong>现代深度网络</strong> 的失准最受关注：Guo 等 2017 年的经典发现是，随着网络变深变宽、用了 BN 与更强正则，测试精度在升，但校准在恶化——网络系统性过度自信。<strong>支持向量机</strong> 则相反，其到超平面的距离经 sigmoid 转换后常欠自信。</p>\n<p>这些失准都近似单调（打分越高、真实概率越大的趋势保持），所以适合用单调映射来修——这正是保序回归的用武之地，其单调假设的合理性在 <a href=\"../foundations/why-isotonic\">为何保序回归</a> 已论证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标准流水线-留出校准集\">标准流水线：留出校准集</h2><p>校准的黄金规则是<strong>绝不在训练分类器的同一批数据上拟合校准映射</strong>——否则校准器会学到训练集上过度乐观的打分分布，在新数据上失效。标准做法有二：</p>\n<p><strong>留出法（holdout）</strong>：把数据分成训练集、校准集、测试集三份，分类器在训练集上学，校准映射（保序回归）在校准集上学，测试集只用于评估。简单，但校准集的数据没参与训练分类器，样本利用率低。</p>\n<p><strong>交叉拟合（cross-fitting）</strong>：K 折，每折用其余 K-1 折训练的分类器给本折打分，汇总所有折的「样本外打分」再统一拟合一个校准映射。scikit-learn 的 <code>CalibratedClassifierCV</code> 默认走这条路，样本利用率高，是小数据集的推荐做法。保序回归接入时把 <code>method=&#39;isotonic&#39;</code> 传给它即可，API 细节见 <a href=\"../practice/isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校准不是万能-它修什么-不修什么\">校准不是万能：它修什么、不修什么</h2><p>必须清楚校准的能力边界。它<strong>能修</strong>「数值系统性偏移」——比如模型整体过度自信，校准把 0.9 拉回 0.6。它<strong>修不了</strong>区分能力——如果模型本身分不开正负样本（AUC≈0.5），校准只能把所有输出压向基础率，不会凭空造出判别力。它也<strong>修不了</strong>分布偏移下的失准——校准集与部署环境分布不同时，学到的映射会失配，这时要么重新校准，要么转向对分布偏移有保证的方法，如兄弟 hub 的 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/foundations/why-conformal-prediction\">共形预测</a>。校准与共形是互补的：前者修概率的「值」，后者保证预测集合的「覆盖率」，两者可叠加使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>完美校准：预测为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本里真实正例比例恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>；校准与区分（AUC）正交。</li>\n<li>保序校准是单调映射，不改排序，因此校准后 AUC 不变。</li>\n<li>提升树/朴素贝叶斯/深网倾向过度自信、SVM 欠自信，但失准多近似单调，适合保序修正。</li>\n<li>铁律：在独立留出校准集或交叉拟合上学映射，绝不复用训练数据。</li>\n<li>校准只修数值偏移，修不了区分力、也修不了分布偏移——后者交给共形或重新校准。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：保序 vs Platt/温度缩放的正面对比，见 <a href=\"isotonic-vs-platt\">保序与 Platt 缩放</a>；诊断与过拟合，见 <a href=\"reliability-diagrams\">可靠性图与过拟合</a>；单调假设的合理性，见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-isotonic\">为何保序回归</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：覆盖率保证型不确定性，见 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/foundations/why-conformal-prediction\">为何共形预测</a>；分布偏移下的校准失效，见 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/distribution-shift\">分布偏移</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"概率校准：让分类器的 0.9 真的是 90%","id":"概率校准-让分类器的-0-9-真的是-90"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：校准的定义与度量","id":"核心概念-校准的定义与度量"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么模型会失准","id":"为什么模型会失准"},{"level":2,"text":"标准流水线：留出校准集","id":"标准流水线-留出校准集"},{"level":2,"text":"校准不是万能：它修什么、不修什么","id":"校准不是万能-它修什么-不修什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"复杂度与在线：从批量到流式的保序回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/algorithms/complexity"},"next":{"title":"保序与 Platt 缩放：非参数 vs 参数化校准的抉择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/isotonic-vs-platt"}}